{{> Start this}}

{{> CustomLogo this}}

{{!--
  A private status page user's password reset link. The page's name is
  chosen by its team, so every line that carries it is printed through
  plainInfo - escaped - never through the raw `info`.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title="Forgot Password? We're here to help." }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "We received a request to reset the password you use to log in to " statusPageName ". Click the button below to choose a new one.")}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=tokenVerifyUrl buttonText="Reset your password"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=tokenVerifyUrl linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{!--
  Where the request came from (Partials/RequestOriginFields.hbs): anybody
  who knows an address can ask for its reset.
--}}
{{#if requestedAt}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Details of the request:"}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Requested at:" plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info="The password reset email expires in 24 hours."}}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>Didn't ask for this?</strong> You can safely ignore this email. Your password stays the same, and nobody can change it without the link above."}}

{{> InfoBlock info="Thanks, have a great day."}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat statusPageName " Team.")}}
{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
